    "SORT-CHECK",
    "NUMERIC / GUID / extended date"
  ],
  "description": "Branch R-SORT-3 GUID component order (public side) on an ACCDB. GU(ID, G GUID) with 24 GUIDs: all zero; the byte 0x01 at each of the 16 byte positions of the textual form, one position per row; the byte 0x80 at six positions; all FF. Written as braced strings (ID in write order), then CREATE INDEX IX_G, and the IX_G walk and SQL ORDER BY G read. Asks the order in which byte positions and byte values rank (textual group order or a byte-swapped storage order), one byte at a time.",
